  {
   "id": "10-seconds-to-win-190305@major-2023-04-04",
   "gameId": "10-seconds-to-win-190305",
   "displayName": "New Update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-04-04T02:07:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "⯈ Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Improved \"Dash\" Tutorial Board",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• New Menu Buttons Design",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Minor Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⯈ Fifth Level",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The tutorial board was causing a lot of confusion because it wasn't explicit which key to press.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I redid the button design and hope that there are no more questions. I hope you can understand that \"Shift\" does the Dash.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚠️ Attention! ⚠️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After this update the old saves will no longer be compatible with the game, it will be necessary to play again to unlock the levels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I apologize, I tried everything to avoid this, but as the project was old I had to create a new save system to be compatible with Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
